---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Contact | AInothing.top"
  description="Contact page for AInothing.top editorial questions, factual corrections, and partnership inquiries."
>
  <section class="contact-shell">
    <div class="contact-intro">
      <span class="section-label">Contact</span>
      <h1>Editorial questions, corrections, and partnership notes.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        AInothing.top is a small editorial project. The most useful messages are factual corrections,
        better source links, and sharp suggestions for revenue case studies that deserve a teardown.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <article class="contact-card card-surface">
        <h2>Best reasons to reach out</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A revenue number needs correction or better sourcing.</li>
          <li>An article missed an important business-model constraint.</li>
          <li>You have a public case study that fits the site's editorial lens.</li>
          <li>You want to discuss a relevant sponsorship or partnership.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="contact-card card-surface">
        <h2>Current contact setup</h2>
        <p>
          A public contact channel has not been added to this build yet. Before launch, replace this section with the
          preferred email address, form, or social profile for editorial communication.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="contact-card card-surface full-width">
        <h2>What helps most</h2>
        <p>
          When sending a correction or tip, include the original source, the claimed number, the time period,
          and why the framing may be incomplete. Specific evidence is much more useful than general disagreement.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .contact-shell {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1rem 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    max-width: 52rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-card {
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .contact-card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .contact-card p,
  .contact-card li {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .contact-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .full-width {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
